<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">비&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 고</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"183\" bgcolor=\"#ffcc99\" height=\"46\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;수강신청 확인 및</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;변경기간</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"254\" height=\"46\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">9. 2(목) ~ 9. 3(금) [2일간]</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"130\" height=\"46\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">수강신청 배너</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">및 학사안내 링크</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"183\" bgcolor=\"#ffcc99\" height=\"46\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;폐강과목<br>&nbsp;수강정정기간</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"254\" height=\"46\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">9. 9(목) ~ 9. 13(월) [5일간]</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"130\" height=\"46\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;대학원지원팀</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">(글412호)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"183\" bgcolor=\"#ffcc99\" height=\"46\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;수강신청 확정일</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"254\" height=\"46\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">9. 26(일)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"130\" height=\"46\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">일반 휴․복학<br>마감일 </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 수강신청 장소</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 교내 : 학과공용PC실, 학과사무실, 도서관정보센터 등의 LAN PC</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 교외 : 인터넷이 가능한 PC에서 우리대학교 홈페이지 접속 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;≪ 수강신청 방법 ≫ </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;◦ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">수강신청배너</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 또는 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">학사안내 수강신청 안내 화면 바로가기</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 링크 접속 후</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;로그인→수강신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;◦ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">해당과목 신청을 원하면 \"INS\"를 삭제를 원하면 \"DEL\" 을 클릭 후 종료 버튼 클릭!</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※ 주의사항 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">수강신청 페이지의 정상적인 이용을 위하여</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> ActiveX를 다운받아 설치</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">하여야만 수강신청페이지가 실행되오니 PC 자체설정 권한을 Administrator로 설정하여 반드시 ActiveX를 다운로드 받아 이용하시기 바랍니다. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">(공용PC실 경우 반드시 PC 관리자 확인 바람)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 수강신청 방법</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;가. 수강신청 변경 절차</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 수강신청 안내문을 숙지한 후 지도교수 또는 주임교수의 지도를 받아 수강신청 할 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">과목을 선택한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 우리대학교 홈페이지의 수강신청배너 접속 후 수강할 과목을 입력한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 입력된 내용을 확인하여 틀린 부분은 수정입력한 후 종료한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">나. 폐강과목 수강신청 정정 절차</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 수강신청한 과목이 <strong>폐강된 경우</strong> 다른 과목으로 정정 신청하는 기간임. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 변경할 과목을 기재한 수강신청카드를 대학원지원팀(글 412호)에 제출한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;※</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 2009학년도 교육과정 개편으로 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">동일ㆍ대체과목으로 지정된 과목을 수강신청하면 종전과목으로 취득한 성적은 삭제되므로</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #9900ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">첨부파일(동일대체과목표)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">을 참고하여 수강신청 하시기 바랍니다</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">금오공과대학교대학원학사운영규정(제4조의 2) 중복이수금지 조항</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">에 의거하여 과목코드번호가 다르더라도 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">과목명이 동일</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">한 경우에는 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">이중수강 처리 되어 학점이 인정되지</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">아니하므로</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> 이 점 참고하여 수강신청 하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;※ 참고사항 : 각 대학원별로 논문연구과목 수강신청시 아래의 표를 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"91\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">구&nbsp; 분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"133\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">교과목</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"118\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">해당학기</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"54\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">이수</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">학점</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"153\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">비 고</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"50\" bgcolor=\"#ccff99\" height=\"141\" rowspan=\"3\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">대학원</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"40\" bgcolor=\"#ccff99\" height=\"81\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">석사</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"133\" height=\"81\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;논문연구</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"118\" height=\"81\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4학기차</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double